+Changes (docs/measurement/ttfv-protocol.md, receipt.template.json, receipts/README.md)
+1. q2 now asks "Who is it for, and what must their agent expose for ARCI to test it?"; (a) and (b) kept.
+2. q4: correct if each of two items is a limit stated in the README under test (package.readme_url) under "What it does not do" or in the first-screen boundary sentence; old list kept as "For example: ...".
+3. Store location: "unless `--out` names another directory".
