+8. §5.1: a reader who completes no track is still asked all five and counts in the "k of n readers" denominator.
+9. outcome.trials_started added to template (trials.jsonl exists and non-empty); defined in §4.6; §9.1 kill criterion = descriptor_hand_edited false AND trials_started true.
+10. Handle-only/no-personal-data notes for facilitator (template top _comment, §7.3), comprehension.scorer (template comment, §7.3), receipts README; network defined as precondition 2.7 and in the template _comment.
